{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_10_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a550e4a501c349bff378e41953e5c77023cfee0e63e34748c45fd70ae1cd0f25",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_e:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f253ab991bf396a1a4ab9421a05fdc3cb29ddef3284dd83cb63c8412ed6ad5a7",
      "text": "来～看，是可爱的猫咪照片哦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e310cba846eef32c530b4de7a7a120bea3d9ae234dc1f9e8bf1a416743669cc",
      "text": "这、这是……！\n居然在这种场合亮出猫来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:936152b0ff5aa06783f58c777f0de9f5a76aac4371df0435924a6f0149b88c87",
      "text": "虽然不能违抗上面的指示……但猫太可爱了！\n看着猫的样子身心放松下来，忍不住吐露心声了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_e:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bae8b7ec7d9a3e5a013347bc8cf115bdd1280f97e51972774e7d7e9e30dc52d1",
      "text": "……其实我们，也很想为\n一同支撑着男极的315 Pro加油打气啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a225c5eb482aca02c88c849a39692c860e250ade2ef00c29f7e7499c316a109",
      "text": "我们豁出去了。\n带各位去休息室！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_e:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4f8010431433a3eb7e4b790e02903ff4344a4f70a54614bc86dfabb7d7463eb",
      "text": "居然能接二连三地收买工作人员，\n猫的力量还真是伟大啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_e:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:baec56791d267c6b8bfff65206e0c14a24d7b7c13eb1102e5332ab758c02a6bd",
      "text": "休息室就在拐过那个弯角的地方呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_e:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf6fa2fccca06304c271c615ff7d2e083fc46b269a742c2d6f77ca07f0821fb1",
      "text": "各位，这次真的要到……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_e:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a865fe7fbf1456bfb933150083ad2a0bc8873cd437109ea594bcc78b69fc9d57",
      "text": "且慢——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_e:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:184a63bd485ccc557f3c303d1b066bec82a22bb5a1d6ea421251d91c96609c7a",
      "text": "！？你们是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_e:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7efe9924eb6c233f95d59f277f6805d910641bc89e0616897ae558cf6d70482",
      "text": "亏你们能走到这里啊，315 Production。\n但是，从这里开始休想通过！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_e:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c372ba95bdc253400c1ba8f5ae22124357fb41fa58a6e3b9f1742ce4663de3ac",
      "text": "不好意思，我们跟其他工作人员不同，\n最讨厌的就是315 Production了……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_e:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:113df8249994e24ba007ce6a07eb23ef7a99940a8289943809a754adb1f3edf2",
      "text": "呜……休息室明明就在眼前了。\n到底该怎么办才好……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_e:cmd-000180:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af31be474b1bf2796db235891d4607996346ee701729995c4058f1d05f72f76e",
      "text": "……看来该轮到我们出场了啊，硲先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_e:cmd-000183:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ea2f09652bf7b3a07b2a341e114e84d48acc929a1fcf447f2d338e57b749ccd",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_e:cmd-000197:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a905b6208ad2a42b35e084809b4917591a7cab6aeca55120709ff42797c4cf03",
      "text": "道夫先生，还有雨彦！难道说，\n现在要告诉我们那身同款打扮的含义了吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
